POST   /api/v1/auth/seller/register
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Purpose:  Complete seller registration after OTP verify
Auth:     None (uses temp token from OTP verify)
 
REQUEST:
{
  "phoneNumber": "+919876543210",
  "otpToken": "temp_token_from_verify",
  "businessName": "Ravi's Pizza",
  "ownerName": "Ravi Sharma",
  "email": "ravi@pizza.com",
  "primaryCity": "Mumbai",
  "primaryCategory": "Food",
  "referralCode": "ADT-PRIYA-001"  // optional
}
 
RESPONSE 201:
{
  "data": {
    "sellerId": 42,
    "referralCode": "ADT-RAVI-042",
    "accessToken": "eyJ...",
    "refreshToken": "rft_...",
    "welcomePointsAwarded": 75
  }
}
 
BUSINESS LOGIC:
  1. Validate temp token
  2. Check phone not already registered
  3. Create Seller record
  4. Generate unique referral code (ADT-{name}-{id})
  5. If referralCode provided:
     a. Find referrer seller
     b. Create ReferralLink record
     c. Award 25 or 50 points to referrer
     d. Add to PointLedger
  6. Award 75 welcome points to new seller
  7. Generate full JWT
  8. Send welcome WhatsApp message
  9. Log to AuditLog
