Purpose:  Release lock if seller abandons checkout
 
BUSINESS LOGIC:
  1. Verify lockToken belongs to this seller
  2. Delete Redis key
  3. Update Pixels.Status = 'Available'
  4. Broadcast SignalR: "PixelReleased" { pixelId }
 
