POST   /api/v1/payments/verify
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Auth:     Seller
Purpose:  Verify Razorpay payment signature and activate pixel
 
REQUEST:
{
  "razorpayOrderId": "order_abc123",
  "razorpayPaymentId": "pay_xyz789",
  "razorpaySignature": "hmac_sig",
  "lockToken": "lock_abc123"
}
 
BUSINESS LOGIC (TRANSACTION — all or nothing):
  BEGIN TRANSACTION
    1. Verify HMAC signature:
       expected = HMAC_SHA256(orderId + "|" + paymentId, secret)
       If mismatch → 400 Bad Request, log fraud attempt
    
    2. Verify lockToken still in Redis
    
    3. Update Transaction: Status = 'Success', PaymentId
    
    4. Create Shop record:
       StartDate = NOW, EndDate = NOW + durationMonths
    
    5. Update Pixel:
       Status = 'Sold'
       CurrentShopId = new ShopId
       LockedBySellerId = NULL
       LockExpiresAt = NULL
    
    6. Delete Redis lock key
    
    7. Create Ad record (empty Draft — seller fills later)
    
    8. Redeem points if applied:
       Deduct from Sellers.PointsBalance
       Insert negative PointLedger entry
    
    9. Generate Invoice:
       InvoiceNumber = INV-{YYYY}-{6-digit-sequence}
       Calculate CGST/SGST vs IGST
       Generate PDF (QuestPDF) → upload to Blob Storage
       Store Invoice record
    
    10. Update Transaction.InvoiceId
    
    11. Send WhatsApp to seller:
        "🎉 Your pixel is now LIVE! Invoice #INV-... attached."
    
    12. Broadcast SignalR to BuyerHub: "PixelSold" { pixelId }
    
    13. Broadcast SignalR to AdminHub: 
        "NewRevenue" { amount, city, category }
  
  COMMIT TRANSACTION
 
RESPONSE 200:
{
  "data": {
    "shopId": 55,
    "pixelId": 101,
    "invoiceNumber": "INV-2025-000042",
    "invoicePdfUrl": "https://...",
    "adSetupUrl": "/seller/ads/55/setup"
  }
}
 
