POST   /api/v1/payments/webhook/razorpay
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Auth:     Razorpay webhook secret (X-Razorpay-Signature header)
Purpose:  Handle async payment events from Razorpay
 
EVENTS HANDLED:
  payment.captured  → Mark transaction success (if not already)
  payment.failed    → Mark transaction failed, release pixel lock
  refund.created    → Record refund in Transaction
 
BUSINESS LOGIC for payment.failed:
  1. Find transaction by orderId
  2. Update Status = 'Failed'
  3. Release Redis pixel lock
  4. Update Pixel.Status = 'Available'
  5. Broadcast SignalR: "PixelReleased" { pixelId }
  6. Notify seller: "Payment failed. Your pixel hold is released."
